  "description": "Modbus TCP/UDP protocol library. Implements Modbus Application Protocol V1.1b3 with full 19 function codes (12 public + 7 advanced). Supports ModbusTCP, ModbusUDP, ModbusRtuOverTCP, ModbusRtuOverUDP transport variants. Built on NewLife.IoT standard interfaces with APM tracing support and built-in runtime messages in 31 languages.  |  Modbus TCP/UDP 协议库，完整实现 Modbus 应用协议 V1.1b3 的 19 个功能码（12 个公共 + 7 个进阶），支持 ModbusTCP、ModbusUDP、ModbusRtuOverTCP、ModbusRtuOverUDP 传输变体，基于 NewLife.IoT 标准接口，内置 APM 链路追踪与 31 种语言运行时消息。",
